        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "RT-MEDIUM-1 — MEDIUM-1's fix only covers 4 of the declared-shape fields that silently vanish when combined with inline provenance; `missionId`/`role`/`reason`/`policy`/`expectedFiles` still do",
          "anchor": "rt-medium-1-medium-1s-fix-only-covers-4-of-the-declared-shape-fields-that-silently-vanish-when-combined-with-inline-provenance-missionidrolereasonpolicyexpectedfiles-still-do",
          "githubAnchor": "rt-medium-1-medium-1s-fix-only-covers-4-of-the-declared-shape-fields-that-silently-vanish-when-combined-with-inline-provenance-missionidrolereasonpolicyexpectedfiles-still-do",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c44d4240c107"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "RT-MEDIUM-2 — `isReadOnlyAssignment()`'s legacy heuristic disagrees with the new guaranteed-read-only `mutation` stamp TODAY, for a combination Review's own LOW-2 claimed was impossible until a future \"inline mutating\" cell",
          "anchor": "rt-medium-2-isreadonlyassignments-legacy-heuristic-disagrees-with-the-new-guaranteed-read-only-mutation-stamp-today-for-a-combination-reviews-own-low-2-claimed-was-impossible-until-a-future-inline-mutating-cell",
          "githubAnchor": "rt-medium-2-isreadonlyassignments-legacy-heuristic-disagrees-with-the-new-guaranteed-read-only-mutation-stamp-today-for-a-combination-reviews-own-low-2-claimed-was-impossible-until-a-future-inline-mutating-cell",
          "stableAnchor": "h-547c82b23ec7"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "RT-LOW-1 — `caller.writerId` sanitization collapses distinct, individually-valid writerIds into the identical assignment-id token",
