          "githubAnchor": "gitnexus-high-risk-classification-independently-verified-coordinators-read-is-correct",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f2ea038cf301"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH — `mission-lite.mjs:runMissionAssignment`'s string-ID read-back path has the exact same unfixed \"assignment.json predates the `mutation` field\" bug this cell's scope-widening just fixed for `operation-choice.mjs`, and it fails in the opposite (false-refusal) direction",
          "anchor": "high-mission-litemjsrunmissionassignments-string-id-read-back-path-has-the-exact-same-unfixed-assignmentjson-predates-the-mutation-field-bug-this-cells-scope-widening-just-fixed-for-operation-choicemjs-and-it-fails-in-the-opposite-false-refusal-direction",
          "githubAnchor": "high-mission-litemjsrunmissionassignments-string-id-read-back-path-has-the-exact-same-unfixed-assignmentjson-predates-the-mutation-field-bug-this-cells-scope-widening-just-fixed-for-operation-choicemjs-and-it-fails-in-the-opposite-false-refusal-direction",
          "stableAnchor": "h-86f17afd9f4b"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM — `cli.mjs`'s `execute --assignment` path never passes `opts.isMissionLite`, so `validateAssignmentLegality`'s mission-refusal gate is now unconditionally inert for this real, tested, documented caller",
          "anchor": "medium-climjss-execute---assignment-path-never-passes-optsismissionlite-so-validateassignmentlegalitys-mission-refusal-gate-is-now-unconditionally-inert-for-this-real-tested-documented-caller",
