          "stableAnchor": "h-ca71150ab4db"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "`validateAssignmentLegality`'s narrowed `isMission` — Bug Taxonomy's \"conflating gate with classification\" concern, checked and clear",
          "anchor": "validateassignmentlegalitys-narrowed-ismission-bug-taxonomys-conflating-gate-with-classification-concern-checked-and-clear",
          "githubAnchor": "validateassignmentlegalitys-narrowed-ismission-bug-taxonomys-conflating-gate-with-classification-concern-checked-and-clear",
          "stableAnchor": "h-795fa263d700"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
