        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "NEW FINDING — MEDIUM: `createMissionAssignment`'s assignment-ID allocation is a real TOCTOU race; concurrent callers under the same writer identity can collide on the same assignmentId, silently drop one caller's real Assignment content, and leave `thread.jsonl` self-inconsistent with no error raised anywhere",
          "anchor": "new-finding-medium-createmissionassignments-assignment-id-allocation-is-a-real-toctou-race-concurrent-callers-under-the-same-writer-identity-can-collide-on-the-same-assignmentid-silently-drop-one-callers-real-assignment-content-and-leave-threadjsonl-self-inconsistent-with-no-error-raised-anywhere",
          "githubAnchor": "new-finding-medium-createmissionassignments-assignment-id-allocation-is-a-real-toctou-race-concurrent-callers-under-the-same-writer-identity-can-collide-on-the-same-assignmentid-silently-drop-one-callers-real-assignment-content-and-leave-threadjsonl-self-inconsistent-with-no-error-raised-anywhere",
          "stableAnchor": "h-68cb118dd8f3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Attack 1 — `cli.mjs`'s widened `isMissionLite` gate: no non-mission-lite inline producer exists today; a same-access-level bypass exists but is not a new exposure",
          "anchor": "attack-1-climjss-widened-ismissionlite-gate-no-non-mission-lite-inline-producer-exists-today-a-same-access-level-bypass-exists-but-is-not-a-new-exposure",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-1-climjss-widened-ismissionlite-gate-no-non-mission-lite-inline-producer-exists-today-a-same-access-level-bypass-exists-but-is-not-a-new-exposure",
          "stableAnchor": "h-aba7914f99cb"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Attack 2 — forging a `thread.jsonl` TASK message to hijack mission membership: no reachable surface beyond the already-accepted filesystem-tamper boundary",
          "anchor": "attack-2-forging-a-threadjsonl-task-message-to-hijack-mission-membership-no-reachable-surface-beyond-the-already-accepted-filesystem-tamper-boundary",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-2-forging-a-threadjsonl-task-message-to-hijack-mission-membership-no-reachable-surface-beyond-the-already-accepted-filesystem-tamper-boundary",
          "stableAnchor": "h-eec06992f608"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Attack 4 — `resultRef` path construction: `assignmentId` charset-sanitized at the only place it's ever generated, no traversal path found",
          "anchor": "attack-4-resultref-path-construction-assignmentid-charset-sanitized-at-the-only-place-its-ever-generated-no-traversal-path-found",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-4-resultref-path-construction-assignmentid-charset-sanitized-at-the-only-place-its-ever-generated-no-traversal-path-found",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9eb90ea50b20"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Attack 5 — `synthesizeMission`'s RESULT-message-by-`assignmentId` Map: correct for the legitimate single-caller-retry case, checked directly",
          "anchor": "attack-5-synthesizemissions-result-message-by-assignmentid-map-correct-for-the-legitimate-single-caller-retry-case-checked-directly",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-5-synthesizemissions-result-message-by-assignmentid-map-correct-for-the-legitimate-single-caller-retry-case-checked-directly",
          "stableAnchor": "h-140a82e28a51"
        },
