        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH — the deferred MEDIUM is not a theoretical concurrency edge case: two genuinely-simultaneous `--contract` invocations under the same writer identity collide and silently discard one caller's real request, exactly reproducing the just-fixed HIGH's false-success shape",
