        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "LOW — full-suite flake pattern recurred a third time, this run with three different non-baseline failures, none touching this cell's diff — strengthens rather than weakens the \"environmental flake\" read",
          "anchor": "low-full-suite-flake-pattern-recurred-a-third-time-this-run-with-three-different-non-baseline-failures-none-touching-this-cells-diff-strengthens-rather-than-weakens-the-environmental-flake-read",
