        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MED-1 — provenance companion fields never checked against the authorization they name",
          "anchor": "med-1-provenance-companion-fields-never-checked-against-the-authorization-they-name",
          "githubAnchor": "med-1-provenance-companion-fields-never-checked-against-the-authorization-they-name",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4e90f4081762"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MED-2 — binding invocation cap enforced on only ONE of two writing branches",
          "anchor": "med-2-binding-invocation-cap-enforced-on-only-one-of-two-writing-branches",
          "githubAnchor": "med-2-binding-invocation-cap-enforced-on-only-one-of-two-writing-branches",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e54d42e28645"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MED-3 — default taskKey makes a second authorized invocation a silent no-op",
          "anchor": "med-3-default-taskkey-makes-a-second-authorized-invocation-a-silent-no-op",
          "githubAnchor": "med-3-default-taskkey-makes-a-second-authorized-invocation-a-silent-no-op",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2feda549e18f"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MED-4 — same-session scope check was whole-string-prefix-anchored, not segment-based",
          "anchor": "med-4-same-session-scope-check-was-whole-string-prefix-anchored-not-segment-based",
          "githubAnchor": "med-4-same-session-scope-check-was-whole-string-prefix-anchored-not-segment-based",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e5c317ade33d"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "L1 — `assertRefsOwnedBySession` was a byte-for-byte copy of `validateConsultProposal`'s inline rule, not a reuse",
          "anchor": "l1-assertrefsownedbysession-was-a-byte-for-byte-copy-of-validateconsultproposals-inline-rule-not-a-reuse",
          "githubAnchor": "l1-assertrefsownedbysession-was-a-byte-for-byte-copy-of-validateconsultproposals-inline-rule-not-a-reuse",
          "stableAnchor": "h-36c36062f7f5"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "L2, L3, L4 — no code change, recorded as-is",
          "anchor": "l2-l3-l4-no-code-change-recorded-as-is",
          "githubAnchor": "l2-l3-l4-no-code-change-recorded-as-is",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5358040eb6be"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "R7 ruling — the two counting layers are intentionally asymmetric, and the issuance layer is stricter than the contract's literal wording",
          "anchor": "r7-ruling-the-two-counting-layers-are-intentionally-asymmetric-and-the-issuance-layer-is-stricter-than-the-contracts-literal-wording",
          "githubAnchor": "r7-ruling-the-two-counting-layers-are-intentionally-asymmetric-and-the-issuance-layer-is-stricter-than-the-contracts-literal-wording",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3daf6911fc68"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "R8 ruling — accept the comparison as implemented; do NOT record R8 as closed",
