          "level": 1,
          "text": "P06.3 — Independent Review (Proof And Promotion, closes Phase 06 / MVP6)",
          "anchor": "p063-independent-review-proof-and-promotion-closes-phase-06-mvp6",
          "githubAnchor": "p063-independent-review-proof-and-promotion-closes-phase-06-mvp6",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9762ccf19984"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Verdict",
          "anchor": "verdict",
          "githubAnchor": "verdict",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0fa59eb9187f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What I independently verified as correct",
          "anchor": "what-i-independently-verified-as-correct",
          "githubAnchor": "what-i-independently-verified-as-correct",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d84f396b4e28"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Findings",
          "anchor": "findings",
          "githubAnchor": "findings",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a58caf165798"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1. MEDIUM — a window with an empty `opensAfter.operationRefs[]` is permanently open, and the promoted text neither names it nor tests it",
          "anchor": "1-medium-a-window-with-an-empty-opensafteroperationrefs-is-permanently-open-and-the-promoted-text-neither-names-it-nor-tests-it",
          "githubAnchor": "1-medium-a-window-with-an-empty-opensafteroperationrefs-is-permanently-open-and-the-promoted-text-neither-names-it-nor-tests-it",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a02d0a9c26b5"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "2. MEDIUM — two decisions P06.2 explicitly assigned to P06.3 were never recorded as decided",
          "anchor": "2-medium-two-decisions-p062-explicitly-assigned-to-p063-were-never-recorded-as-decided",
          "githubAnchor": "2-medium-two-decisions-p062-explicitly-assigned-to-p063-were-never-recorded-as-decided",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9a686fba0ee8"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "3. MEDIUM-LOW — the promoted \"Required Negative Tests\" section asserts a test that does not exist",
          "anchor": "3-medium-low-the-promoted-required-negative-tests-section-asserts-a-test-that-does-not-exist",
          "githubAnchor": "3-medium-low-the-promoted-required-negative-tests-section-asserts-a-test-that-does-not-exist",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b1ce73e884ce"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "4. LOW — the foreign-session guarantee is stated in absolute form, but rests on the event-log invariant, not on any session scoping of `assignments/`",
          "anchor": "4-low-the-foreign-session-guarantee-is-stated-in-absolute-form-but-rests-on-the-event-log-invariant-not-on-any-session-scoping-of-assignments",
          "githubAnchor": "4-low-the-foreign-session-guarantee-is-stated-in-absolute-form-but-rests-on-the-event-log-invariant-not-on-any-session-scoping-of-assignments",
          "stableAnchor": "h-df811ab4a2c2"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "5. LOW — \"it is the only channel consulted\" overstates what the code does",
          "anchor": "5-low-it-is-the-only-channel-consulted-overstates-what-the-code-does",
          "githubAnchor": "5-low-it-is-the-only-channel-consulted-overstates-what-the-code-does",
          "stableAnchor": "h-68cd6a42a142"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "6. LOW — the `CoordinationProtocol` YAML shape block was not updated",
          "anchor": "6-low-the-coordinationprotocol-yaml-shape-block-was-not-updated",
          "githubAnchor": "6-low-the-coordinationprotocol-yaml-shape-block-was-not-updated",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5516ef00cf7b"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7. LOW — the terminal-authorization test's first assertion is too loose to prove what the scenario is about",
          "anchor": "7-low-the-terminal-authorization-tests-first-assertion-is-too-loose-to-prove-what-the-scenario-is-about",
          "githubAnchor": "7-low-the-terminal-authorization-tests-first-assertion-is-too-loose-to-prove-what-the-scenario-is-about",
          "stableAnchor": "h-71e6659ee197"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "8. LOW — no `## [Unreleased]` CHANGELOG entry for visibility windows or the newly shipped core protocol",
          "anchor": "8-low-no-unreleased-changelog-entry-for-visibility-windows-or-the-newly-shipped-core-protocol",
          "githubAnchor": "8-low-no-unreleased-changelog-entry-for-visibility-windows-or-the-newly-shipped-core-protocol",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c4bc04b69415"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Baseline note on the regression sweep",
          "anchor": "baseline-note-on-the-regression-sweep",
          "githubAnchor": "baseline-note-on-the-regression-sweep",
          "stableAnchor": "h-cbeebc9f9084"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Not findings (checked and dismissed)",
          "anchor": "not-findings-checked-and-dismissed",
          "githubAnchor": "not-findings-checked-and-dismissed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7fb6c3c43b9c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Unresolved questions for the Coordinator",
          "anchor": "unresolved-questions-for-the-coordinator",
          "githubAnchor": "unresolved-questions-for-the-coordinator",
          "stableAnchor": "h-25e999c87a44"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Final Recheck (independent, post Fix Round)",
          "anchor": "final-recheck-independent-post-fix-round",
          "githubAnchor": "final-recheck-independent-post-fix-round",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e3f00915feaf"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Per-item verdicts",
          "anchor": "per-item-verdicts",
          "githubAnchor": "per-item-verdicts",
          "stableAnchor": "h-dba319eaf895"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Regression sweep, re-run independently",
          "anchor": "regression-sweep-re-run-independently",
          "githubAnchor": "regression-sweep-re-run-independently",
          "stableAnchor": "h-54bdc8afff32"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "New finding",
          "anchor": "new-finding",
          "githubAnchor": "new-finding",
          "stableAnchor": "h-56e307b13856"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "NEW (LOW–MEDIUM) — the Residuals umbrella sentence claims all three residuals need raw store-door access; residual 2 needs none",
          "anchor": "new-lowmedium-the-residuals-umbrella-sentence-claims-all-three-residuals-need-raw-store-door-access-residual-2-needs-none",
